    goal: "family-time", tier: "advanced", section: "9158",
    title: "Ask for Facilitated Advance Care Planning Through Your Parent's Clinician",
    subtitle: "A randomized trial found facilitated planning made end-of-life wishes known and followed for 86% of patients versus 30%, with less anxiety and depression in relatives",
