    action: "List every family-relevant policy your employer offers (flexible hours, compressed weeks, remote days, leave, backup childcare) and pick the one that would buy the most family time. Before using it, ask your supervisor for a short conversation about how it would work for the team, agree how you will stay reachable, and start with a defined trial period.",
